{"2124050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zaxoid", "steam_appid": 2124050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an alien onslaught in Zaxoid, an adrenaline inducing, twin-stick mayhem shooter! Defend the galaxy from relentless invaders by upgrading your ship or fortifying your city with strategic choices that make every run unique. Wield dual joysticks for precision chaos, transform into tank mode to repel surface invasions, and protect your population. Intense gameplay that takes you back to the golden years of gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/ef06376dad9ec4db468837c3a511aea8.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/ef06376dad9ec4db468837c3a511aea8.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Combat, Pure Adrenaline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your gamepad and lock in for an old-school, twin-stick adrenaline rush. Snap-tight controls, razor-sharp movement, and nonstop enemies combine to recreate the feeling of standing at a neon-lit arcade cabinet. Every encounter becomes a test of timing, twitch reflexes, and pure arcade instincts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/49bb166c9b86680d58fb6ffa3bbcbe5a.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/49bb166c9b86680d58fb6ffa3bbcbe5a.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Combinations, Infinite Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score epic upgrades for your ship and city, crafting a unique build every run. Augment your systems with experimental tech, channel energy through exotic weapons, and reinforce your city’s defenses with an evolving suite of enhancements. Adapt fast or get overwhelmed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/c6454ff0bcd2ee346b7f763af6cc9ac6.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/c6454ff0bcd2ee346b7f763af6cc9ac6.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the Line Against the Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build turrets, cloning facilities, and space programs to protect your population. Strengthen your city one structure at a time, layering automated defenses and powerful upgrades to withstand relentless enemy assaults.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/fb7842ce6fe7026c6879affc4f4ac6eb.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/fb7842ce6fe7026c6879affc4f4ac6eb.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the Stars, Hold Your Ground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on missions that shift between intense space dogfights and heavy ground combat. Pilot your strike ship in orbit, then roll out in a fortified tank for planet-side warfare. Each mission tests a different skillset as you battle across both fronts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an alien onslaught in Zaxoid, an adrenaline inducing, twin-stick mayhem shooter! Defend the galaxy from relentless invaders by upgrading your ship or fortifying your city with strategic choices that make every run unique. Wield dual joysticks for precision chaos, transform into tank mode to repel surface invasions, and protect your population. Intense gameplay that takes you back to the golden years of gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/ef06376dad9ec4db468837c3a511aea8.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/ef06376dad9ec4db468837c3a511aea8.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Combat, Pure Adrenaline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your gamepad and lock in for an old-school, twin-stick adrenaline rush. Snap-tight controls, razor-sharp movement, and nonstop enemies combine to recreate the feeling of standing at a neon-lit arcade cabinet. Every encounter becomes a test of timing, twitch reflexes, and pure arcade instincts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/49bb166c9b86680d58fb6ffa3bbcbe5a.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/49bb166c9b86680d58fb6ffa3bbcbe5a.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Combinations, Infinite Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score epic upgrades for your ship and city, crafting a unique build every run. Augment your systems with experimental tech, channel energy through exotic weapons, and reinforce your city’s defenses with an evolving suite of enhancements. Adapt fast or get overwhelmed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/c6454ff0bcd2ee346b7f763af6cc9ac6.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/c6454ff0bcd2ee346b7f763af6cc9ac6.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the Line Against the Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build turrets, cloning facilities, and space programs to protect your population. Strengthen your city one structure at a time, layering automated defenses and powerful upgrades to withstand relentless enemy assaults.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/fb7842ce6fe7026c6879affc4f4ac6eb.poster.avif?t=1785183606\" width=850 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/extras/fb7842ce6fe7026c6879affc4f4ac6eb.webm?t=1785183606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the Stars, Hold Your Ground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on missions that shift between intense space dogfights and heavy ground combat. Pilot your strike ship in orbit, then roll out in a fortified tank for planet-side warfare. Each mission tests a different skillset as you battle across both fronts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Defend your planet in this twin-stick mayhem shooter. Rip through alien hordes across a seamless spherical battlefield while upgrading your ship and fortifying your city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/12825c777239e2cefd51b00a76b441a5c515d358/header.jpg?t=1785183606", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/2ce6d56e4d1ddec9fe5fa927142a8161aa58a853/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785183606", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124050/2ce6d56e4d1ddec9fe5fa927142a8161aa58a853/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785183606", "website": "https://www.zaxoid.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> n/a</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</st